@startuml
!theme plain
title TASK-260715-whtdsf — CI trust boundary

actor "Fork / untrusted PR" as Fork
actor "Trusted maintainer" as Maintainer
queue "Protected tag or approved dispatch" as Trigger

rectangle "Credential-free CI" as PRCI {
  component "Board/spec + generator drift" as Docs
  component "Core/protocol + Apple compile + relay smoke" as Tests
  component "Secret/license/SBOM policy" as Scans
}

rectangle "Protected release orchestration" as Release {
  component "Immutable candidate manifest" as Manifest
  component "Serialized promotion" as Promote
}

node "macOS GitHub Environment" as MacEnv
node "iOS App Store Environment" as IOSEnv
node "Relay staging / provenance" as RelayEnv
artifact "Redacted evidence bundle" as Evidence

Fork --> PRCI : read-only token\nno production secrets
Maintainer --> PRCI : same required gates
PRCI --> Evidence : results + digests
Trigger --> Manifest : approved immutable commit
Evidence --> Manifest : all blocking checks pass
Manifest --> Promote
Promote --> MacEnv : scoped Developer ID/notary/GitHub credentials
Promote --> IOSEnv : scoped Apple Distribution/App Store credentials
Promote --> RelayEnv : verified staged bytes only
MacEnv --> Evidence
IOSEnv --> Evidence
RelayEnv --> Evidence

note bottom of PRCI
No protected environment, signing material,
publication token, or privileged runner is
reachable from pull-request code.
end note
@enduml